#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1101
msgid "How Plugin Works?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1104
msgid "Frank Dead Link Checker scans your WordPress website to find broken links, redirects, and other link issues. It checks links inside posts, pages, and Gutenberg block content. Here is how it works:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1112
msgid "Scanning Modes"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1115
msgid "Manual Scan (Scan Now)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1117
msgid "Click the \"Scan Now\" button on the Dashboard to start a full scan manually. The plugin will:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1120
msgid "Discover all links from your selected content types (Posts and Pages)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1121
msgid "Parse Gutenberg block content to find embedded links."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1122
msgid "Check each link by sending HTTP HEAD/GET requests to verify if the URL responds correctly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1123
msgid "Categorize links as Working (200 OK), Broken (4xx/5xx errors), or Warning (redirects, slow responses)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1124
msgid "Display results on the Dashboard with filters for easy review."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1127
msgid "Automatic Scan (Scheduled)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1129
msgid "When Scan Type is set to \"Automatic\" in Settings, the plugin will automatically scan your website at the frequency you choose (Weekly). This runs in the background using WordPress Cron — no manual action needed. Set Scan Type to \"Manual\" to disable automatic scanning entirely."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1132
msgid "Auto-Recheck (Broken Links Only)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1134
msgid "A lightweight background task that automatically rechecks links already marked as broken or warning every 6 hours. This helps detect when a previously broken link has been fixed — without running a full scan. It checks up to 50 links at a time and skips dismissed links."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1139
msgid "Use the \"Fresh Scan\" button to clear ALL existing link data and scan history, then start a completely new scan from scratch. This is useful when you want a clean slate — for example, after making major changes to your website structure."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1147
msgid "What If a Scan Gets Stuck?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-frankdlc-admin.php:1150
